{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Vikram, the protagonist set to find out what's going wrong in his home-town Vishwapur, a fictional land based in India. In this RPG, go through a handcrafted India from a past time, with areas and story based loosely on Indian mythology.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WHAT'S WRONG WITH THIS TOWN?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vishwapur is being overrun by schemers, demons, and mutated creatures. But why? What happened to this once peaceful town? Uncover who (or what) poisoned\u00a0the town through cinematic storytelling, optional lore scrolls, and encounters that reveal more with every challenging boss victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054220/extras/508e41b77c18c349240d9c8096ef1386.avif?t=1760980273\" width=960 height=540 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MASTER THE SWORD AND THE FRAGMENTED CHAKRA</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get access to a plethora of sword arts, combo modifiers, and a chakra that you can throw (and re-throw!) to enable fast-paced gameplay versus enemies. One chakra ability can return back to you, the other you can teleport to. You can use a lot of these in conjunction with each other.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054220/extras/b5134b3aea0e1c82bd9e75b23bd694da.poster.avif?t=1760980273\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054220/extras/b5134b3aea0e1c82bd9e75b23bd694da.webm?t=1760980273\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054220/extras/b5134b3aea0e1c82bd9e75b23bd694da.mp4?t=1760980273\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WIELD GODLIKE POWERS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the powers conferred to you, even if for a brief moment, to overpower your enemies. Each transformation unlocks new moves, counters, and mobility options, opening fresh ways to approach bosses, break stances, and dominate your enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054220/extras/6d7289f3b1de5e813b47da2cf4f055ac.poster.avif?t=1760980273\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054220/extras/6d7289f3b1de5e813b47da2cf4f055ac.webm?t=1760980273\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054220/extras/6d7289f3b1de5e813b47da2cf4f055ac.mp4?t=1760980273\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you\u2019re into deliberate, high-octane combat with room for mastery, <strong>Unleash the Avatar</strong> is for you. Wishlist to follow development, and tell us which mechanics, builds, or boss styles you want to see next\u2014your feedback helps shape Vishwapur\u2019s future!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4054220?t=1760980273","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4054220?t=1760980273","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054220/58fb799b64db17e9c6d64f6927ca50b42a7a3035/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760980273","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054220/58fb799b64db17e9c6d64f6927ca50b42a7a3035/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760980273","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Vikram, the protagonist set to find out what's going wrong in his home-town Vishwapur, a fictional land based in India. In this RPG, go through a handcrafted India from a past time, with areas and story based loosely on Indian mythology.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WHAT'S WRONG WITH THIS TOWN?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vishwapur is being overrun by schemers, demons, and mutated creatures. But why? What happened to this once peaceful town? Uncover who (or what) poisoned\u00a0the town through cinematic storytelling, optional lore scrolls, and encounters that reveal more with every challenging boss victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054220/extras/508e41b77c18c349240d9c8096ef1386.avif?t=1760980273\" width=960 height=540 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MASTER THE SWORD AND THE FRAGMENTED CHAKRA</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get access to a plethora of sword arts, combo modifiers, and a chakra that you can throw (and re-throw!) to enable fast-paced gameplay versus enemies. One chakra ability can return back to you, the other you can teleport to. You can use a lot of these in conjunction with each other.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054220/extras/b5134b3aea0e1c82bd9e75b23bd694da.poster.avif?t=1760980273\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054220/extras/b5134b3aea0e1c82bd9e75b23bd694da.webm?t=1760980273\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054220/extras/b5134b3aea0e1c82bd9e75b23bd694da.mp4?t=1760980273\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WIELD GODLIKE POWERS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the powers conferred to you, even if for a brief moment, to overpower your enemies. Each transformation unlocks new moves, counters, and mobility options, opening fresh ways to approach bosses, break stances, and dominate your enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054220/extras/6d7289f3b1de5e813b47da2cf4f055ac.poster.avif?t=1760980273\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054220/extras/6d7289f3b1de5e813b47da2cf4f055ac.webm?t=1760980273\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054220/extras/6d7289f3b1de5e813b47da2cf4f055ac.mp4?t=1760980273\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you\u2019re into deliberate, high-octane combat with room for mastery, <strong>Unleash the Avatar</strong> is for you. Wishlist to follow development, and tell us which mechanics, builds, or boss styles you want to see next\u2014your feedback helps shape Vishwapur\u2019s future!</p>","developers":["Aeos Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054220/a238b88b4989cbcb7b06112e61b113293973e9a4/header.jpg?t=1760980273","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstati